      "index": 0,
      "message": {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Based on the provided datasheet for the BQ24650 Stand-Alone Synchronous Buck Battery Charge Controller for Solar Power, here is a comprehensive list of specifications:\n\n**1. Physical Specifications:**\n\n*   **Package Type:** VQFN\n*   **Number of Pins:** 16\n*   **Body Size (Nominal):** 3.50 mm x 3.50 mm\n*   **Exposed Pad:** Yes, exposed thermal pad on the backside for thermal and mechanical performance. Must be soldered to the PCB ground. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf), [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ug/sluu444a/sluu444a.pdf)\n*   **Thermal Pad Dimensions:** 2.14 mm x 2.14 mm (typical) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n\n**2. Electrical Characteristics:**\n\n*   **Input Voltage Range (VCC):** 5 V to 28 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Maximum Input Voltage (Absolute Maximum):** 33 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Charge Voltage Regulation Accuracy:** \u00b10.5% (0\u00b0C to 85\u00b0C), \u00b10.7% (-40\u00b0C to 125\u00b0C) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Charge Current Regulation Accuracy:** \u00b13% [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Input Voltage Regulation Accuracy (MPPSET):** \u00b10.6% [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **MPPSET Regulation Voltage:** 1.2 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Fast Charge Current Sense Voltage Range (SRP-SRN):** 40 mV [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Precharge Current Sense Voltage Range (SRP-SRN):** 4 mV [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Termination Current Sense Voltage Range (SRP-SRN):** 4 mV [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Quiescent Current (OFF-state battery discharge):** < 15 \u03bcA [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Sleep Mode Battery Discharge Current (VFB \u2264 2.1V):** 15 \u03bcA (VCC < VBAT, VCC > VUVLO (SLEEP)) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Thermal Shutdown Temperature (Rising):** 145\u00b0C [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Thermal Shutdown Hysteresis:** 15\u00b0C [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Input Overvoltage Rising Threshold (ACOV on VCC):** 31 V (min), 32 V (typ), 33 V (max) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **AC Undervoltage Rising Threshold (UVLO on VCC):** 3.65 V (min), 3.85 V (typ), 4 V (max) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **AC Undervoltage Hysteresis (Falling):** 350 mV [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **VCC Low Falling Threshold (Disable Charge):** 4.1 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **VCC Low Rising Threshold (Resume Charge):** 4.35 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Sleep Falling Threshold (VCC - VSRN to enter SLEEP):** 40 mV (min), 100 mV (typ), 150 mV (max) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Sleep Hysteresis:** 500 mV [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **BAT Short Falling Threshold (Forced Non-Synchronous Mode):** VSRP falling, 2 V (typ) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **BAT Short Rising Hysteresis:** 200 mV [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Low Charge Current Falling Threshold (VSRP-SRN):** 1.25 mV [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Low Charge Current Rising Hysteresis:** 1.25 mV [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **VREF Regulator Voltage:** 3.267 V (min), 3.3 V (typ), 3.333 V (max) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **VREF Current Limit (VREF = 0 V, VCC > VUVLO):** 35 mA [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **REGN Regulator Voltage (VCC > 10 V, MPPSET > 175 mV):** 5.7 V (min), 6.0 V (typ), 6.3 V (max) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **REGN Current Limit (REGN = 0 V, VCC > VUVLO, MPPSET < 75 mV):** 40 mA [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Wake Timer (Max time charge is enabled):** 500 ms [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Wake Current (RSENSE = 10 M\u03a9):** 50 \u03bcA (min), 125 \u03bcA (typ), 200 \u03bcA (max) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Discharge Timer (Max time discharge current is applied):** 1 sec [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Discharge Current:** 6 mA [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Fault Current (After a timeout fault):** 2 mA [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Termination Qualification Current:** 2 mA [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Termination Qualification Time:** 250 ms [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Wake Threshold (with respect to VREG):** 50 mV [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Discharge Threshold (with respect to VREG):** 1.55 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **PWM Switching Frequency:** 510 kHz (min), 600 kHz (typ), 690 kHz (max) [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **PWM Drivers Dead-Time:** 30 ns [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **STAT1, STAT2 Output Low Saturation Voltage (Sink current = 5 mA):** 0.5 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **STAT1, STAT2 Leakage Current (V = 32 V):** 1.2 \u03bcA [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **TERM_EN Input Low Threshold Voltage:** 0.4 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **TERM_EN Input High Threshold Voltage:** 1.6 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **TERM_EN Bias Current (VTERM_EN = 0.5 V):** 60 \u03bcA [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n\n**3. Operating Conditions:**\n\n*   **Recommended Operating Free-Air Temperature Range:** -40\u00b0C to 85\u00b0C [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Recommended Operating Junction Temperature Range:** -40\u00b0C to 125\u00b0C [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Operating Input Voltage Range (VCC):** 5 V to 28 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Operating PH Voltage:** -2 V to 30 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Operating VFB Voltage:** -0.3 V to 14 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Operating REGN, LODRV, TS, MPPSET, TERM_EN Voltage:** -0.3 V to 6.5 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Operating BTST, HIDRV with respect to GND Voltage:** -0.3 V to 34 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Operating VREF Voltage:** 3.3 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Maximum Difference Voltage (SRP-SRN):** -0.2 V to 0.2 V [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n\n**4. Other Relevant Details:**\n\n*   **Maximum Power Point Tracking (MPPT):** Capability by input voltage regulation, programmable setting. Optimized for solar panel power sources. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Synchronous Buck Controller:** 600-kHz NMOS-NMOS. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Battery Chemistries Accommodated:** Li-Ion/Polymer, LiFePO4, lead acid. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Resistor Programmable Float Voltage:** Yes. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **High Integration:** Internal loop compensation, internal digital soft start. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Safety Features:** Input overvoltage protection, battery temperature-sensing, battery absent detection, thermal shutdown. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Charge Status Outputs:** Provided for LED or host processor (STAT1, STAT2). [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Charge Enable:** On MPPSET pin. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Automatic Sleep Mode:** For low power consumption. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Charge Phases:** Pre-conditioning, constant current, and constant voltage. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Charge Termination:** When current reaches 1/10 of the fast charge rate. Can be disabled by pulling TERM_EN low. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Pre-charge Timer:** Fixed at 30 minutes. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Automatic Recharge:** If battery voltage falls below an internal threshold. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Low Quiescent Current Sleep Mode:** Entered when input voltage falls below battery voltage. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **UVLO Threshold:** Below which the device is disabled and VREF LDO turns off. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Synchronous/Non-Synchronous Operation:** Operates in synchronous mode when SRP-SRN voltage is above 5mV. Forced into non-synchronous mode at low battery voltage or low average SRP-SRN voltage. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Cycle-by-Cycle Charge Undercurrent Protection:** Turns off low-side FET to prevent negative inductor current if SRP-SRN voltage drops below 5mV. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Battery Overvoltage Protection:** Prevents high-side FET from turning on if BAT voltage is above 102% of regulation voltage. Includes current sink to discharge output capacitors. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n*   **Cycle-by-Cycle Charge Overcurrent Protection:** Monitors charge current and prevents it from exceeding 200% of the programmed charge current. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)\n\nThis list provides a structured overview of the key specifications of the BQ24650 based on the provided datasheet. Remember that conditions beyond the recommended operating conditions may cause permanent damage. [ti.com](https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf), [ti.com.cn](http://www.ti.com.cn/cn/lit/ds/symlink/bq24650.pdf)",
